WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:10.746
The spaceship flew toward Blackwood Planet.

2
00:00:10.747 --> 00:00:15.047
Lucy sang.

3
00:00:15.048 --> 00:00:30.747
Ringo covered his ears.

4
00:00:30.748 --> 00:00:37.358
Finally they landed at a campground.

5
00:00:37.359 --> 00:00:41.990
A camper ran over.

6
00:00:41.991 --> 00:00:44.878
"I'm Remy," the camper said.

7
00:00:44.879 --> 00:00:47.423
"My kids are missing!"

8
00:00:47.424 --> 00:00:50.705
"What happened?" Ringo asked.

9
00:00:50.706 --> 00:00:52.842
Remy bit his lip.

10
00:00:52.843 --> 00:00:55.305
"My kids went on a hike this morning.

11
00:00:55.306 --> 00:00:59.041
And they never came back!"

12
00:00:59.042 --> 00:01:03.557
"What do your kids look like?" Ringo asked.

13
00:01:03.558 --> 00:01:06.797
"They're twins," Remy said.

14
00:01:06.798 --> 00:01:11.003
He showed Ringo a picture.

15
00:01:11.004 --> 00:01:14.208
"Where did they hike?" Lucy asked.

16
00:01:14.209 --> 00:01:17.018
"I don't know," Remy said.

17
00:01:17.019 --> 00:01:19.722
"I checked all the open trails nearby.

18
00:01:19.723 --> 00:01:23.882
No one saw them."

19
00:01:23.883 --> 00:01:27.464
Remy showed Lucy a map.

20
00:01:27.465 --> 00:01:30.677
"They wanted to hike Spider Trail.

21
00:01:30.678 --> 00:01:33.769
But it's closed."

22
00:01:33.770 --> 00:01:36.762
"Let's check there," Ringo said.

23
00:01:36.763 --> 00:01:39.754
Lucy looked at the map.

24
00:01:39.755 --> 00:01:42.589
"That's a long trail."

25
00:01:42.590 --> 00:01:57.949
"You can use our Astro bikes," Remy said.

26
00:01:57.950 --> 00:02:13.099
Ringo and Lucy rode to the trail.

27
00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:15.274
Bot read a sign.

28
00:02:15.275 --> 00:02:21.104
"Spider Trail. Closed. Danger."

29
00:02:21.105 --> 00:02:29.544
"Look," PJ said. "Two sets of footprints!"

30
00:02:29.545 --> 00:02:33.051
"They might be the twins' prints," Lucy said.

31
00:02:33.052 --> 00:02:36.186
Ringo gulped.

32
00:02:36.187 --> 00:02:44.876
"Bot, I have a bad feeling about this."

